  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae309fc9b93c4434b888290b1d747f9a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TeacherInteraction
  playerMovement: {fileID: 916875898}
  teacherName: Sarno
  dialoguePopUp: {fileID: 208243415}
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 1165950374}
  spellSelectionScreen: {fileID: 0}
  battleScreen: {fileID: 0}
  element: 
  totalNumOfElementSpells: 0
  initalLines:
  - Hey! Welcome, welcome.
  - Wind can be a harsh discipline, but there is a gentle side to it.
  - Try creating a storm, but make sure to keep it controlled. Then, calm it into
    a gentle breeze.
  - "Let\u2019s get to business here, you need to understand what each of these wind
    runes mean to grasp the wind\u2019s power."
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - All done?
  - Right on.
  - Show me what you know, then.
  afterBattleLines:
  - Solid work.
  - Try this skill next time.
  afterSpellLines:
  - "Hm\u2026it\u2019s colder in here than usual."
  - In any case, keep up the great work!
